{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_05_004_00_5_05_004_00",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:507ac600897b25d08e32aee2f4fd1ff05a0e770ee0b6e47ea2cc7bc234e3e89e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_05_004_00_5_05_004_00:5_05_004_00:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e428c26371df1a9154221c78775aad55d8e33deb4ac6c9d5a9b96c51a9c47c12",
      "text": "展现艺术般的魅力",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_004_00_5_05_004_00:5_05_004_00:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5af07fc73cabd4af1f190e2959fd5e4764a5163bb89be03ae2fce0591290ab4f",
      "text": "摄影与美术专门学校委托道流、实、翔真\n出演广告。\n三人将作为模特，与负责制作的\n知名艺术家进行商谈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_004_00_5_05_004_00:5_05_004_00:cmd-000019:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3bd4b94ccc07076bcf1055f6b600e5c9372f0c31cff6d08c458f7cc3eed545f",
      "text": "FES",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_004_00_5_05_004_00:5_05_004_00:cmd-000019:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e428c26371df1a9154221c78775aad55d8e33deb4ac6c9d5a9b96c51a9c47c12",
      "text": "展现艺术般的魅力",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_004_00_5_05_004_00:5_05_004_00:cmd-000028:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5455700a466c929475645a7f40cdf80891e7b1f1fd4f93ec8b015af1b62b8a3c",
      "text": "专门学校·访谈室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_004_00_5_05_004_00:5_05_004_00:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42b6e78c65a00eeafdcc36a1d7ff83717883cf6f4648ba5ebc5cd8298d9a61a7",
      "text": "辛苦了，制作人。大家都到齐了，\n能给我们讲讲这次商谈的细节吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_004_00_5_05_004_00:5_05_004_00:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:569fd56be371bc33d82104d971dc3513285c0f33186af7be3f5f2cd0d50fd6b6",
      "text": "好的。之前也提前通知过，这次的工作是摄影、\n美术专门学校的广告拍摄。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_004_00_5_05_004_00:5_05_004_00:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df68de51a40352420a97d4ddd285096cd5570dcb94d4e7494a473b81e50766e2",
      "text": "艺术家那边联系我们说，在制作过程中，\n想听听各位的意见。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_004_00_5_05_004_00:5_05_004_00:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65f913097e8754c5ce3e2612b4e043f26611b7ad88a03ab4f00fde7ef28213e1",
      "text": "据说想要做出能活用各位个性的演出呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_004_00_5_05_004_00:5_05_004_00:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:619ba6eccd12770988ceb57ddee8bbd0e6889c8630f6f50fe6e5865c5092d876",
      "text": "原来如此，想听我们的意见啊……怪不得这场碰头会\n定得这么突然呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_004_00_5_05_004_00:5_05_004_00:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6937914e7f900a8540fc84816c45d53ec7e3532dc56f9defc7febcfd235d7fa",
      "text": "既然是想了解我们的话，\n那咱们就别客气，尽管畅所欲言吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_004_00_5_05_004_00:5_05_004_00:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd56bcd328b33c550b506455e68794a298aed34d3aed4ef2d14bfdd44e097402",
      "text": "确实呢。\n有什么想法都告诉对方吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_004_00_5_05_004_00:5_05_004_00:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:119c90bc8702ca669a3ecbeab25f39e300fccf258610f2f56aee03eee7972bff",
      "text": "话又说回来，那位艺术家\n原来是这所学校的毕业生啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_004_00_5_05_004_00:5_05_004_00:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c32fb1129ba75f0681d49d5d73b989267cd9a371d2980b82a2229f03e32ea81f",
      "text": "听说能拍出让人印象深刻的照片，\n最近很有话题度呢。经常听到这个名字。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_004_00_5_05_004_00:5_05_004_00:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:957b5c3a07926c4209188fe2b6a3ad9c214e33c9284533aa4131086a9a3ed705",
      "text": "我也见过！电视广告啦、\n街头的宣传海报啦，也都是那个人拍的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_004_00_5_05_004_00:5_05_004_00:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d7e7da3f003cb960edaefba602e2665eab9425519b5cbd4893ee5ed8184b6d0",
      "text": "能被这么厉害的人来设计演出效果，\n真让人期待啊。要是能活用上花艺知识就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_004_00_5_05_004_00:5_05_004_00:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e64340e2d1b1c291254f3c15e159b2ee81434ac72729cb69803b2318f6e5516d",
      "text": "嗯，为了能让对方好好了解我们，\n好好商量一番吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
